2. Proprietary Core Runtime & Tools (bin/*)
   The compiled core runtime and recompiler binaries distributed in official
   releases (engine.dll, recompiler.exe, nup_tool.exe, shobjpack.exe,
   hz_romfs_pack.exe, bc7cache.exe) are closed-source proprietary software.

   Permission is granted to download and run the unmodified official binary
   distribution for personal, non-commercial use on your own hardware with
   your own legally obtained backup. Redistribution of modified binaries,
   reverse engineering, decompilation, or distribution of any user-generated
   game-derived outputs (including compiled game.dll, packed RomFS data,
   shader caches, or extracted assets) is strictly prohibited.

